    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/21a326c83c220a83bab0bd519d88894f.avif?t=1746078175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where am I\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you woke up, you found yourself in a strange place. According to a boy in the mirror, this place is Noroi Kago. He wants to help you leave, but a barrier prevents him from crossing to the other side. If the boy is going to rescue you, you\u2019ll need to crack the barrier first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To escape, you\u2019ll have to cooperate with your friends and companions, but\u2026 What else is hiding inside this barrier with you? Don\u2019t let the yokai find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/5ede34a7c2f1dcb6940f6bd6ed99f271.poster.avif?t=1746078175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/5ede34a7c2f1dcb6940f6bd6ed99f271.webm?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/5ede34a7c2f1dcb6940f6bd6ed99f271.mp4?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/1e227791f7392e082fe8a4203f2784dd.poster.avif?t=1746078175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/1e227791f7392e082fe8a4203f2784dd.webm?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/1e227791f7392e082fe8a4203f2784dd.mp4?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/b16db2d5838fda6d2a29410cfc5afd1d.avif?t=1746078175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For their own reasons, the yokai inside the barrier won\u2019t try to kill you immediately. Even if you are attacked once, your allies can help you recover and resume your escape. I dread to think of what would happen if you were alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/9ae851bb60816f56c593df6ad0a2dfcb.poster.avif?t=1746078175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/9ae851bb60816f56c593df6ad0a2dfcb.webm?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/9ae851bb60816f56c593df6ad0a2dfcb.mp4?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/48d2cda3c426137a22e4d5438958ff41.avif?t=1746078175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The longer you linger inside the barrier, the more the unearthly aura of the space will erode your humanity, until you become something else. Hold onto your humanity while you make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/c1988e3d7a5c0c9fb197c98aa30a8404.poster.avif?t=1746078175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/c1988e3d7a5c0c9fb197c98aa30a8404.webm?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/c1988e3d7a5c0c9fb197c98aa30a8404.mp4?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/21a326c83c220a83bab0bd519d88894f.avif?t=1746078175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where am I\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you woke up, you found yourself in a strange place. According to a boy in the mirror, this place is Noroi Kago. He wants to help you leave, but a barrier prevents him from crossing to the other side. If the boy is going to rescue you, you\u2019ll need to crack the barrier first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To escape, you\u2019ll have to cooperate with your friends and companions, but\u2026 What else is hiding inside this barrier with you? Don\u2019t let the yokai find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/5ede34a7c2f1dcb6940f6bd6ed99f271.poster.avif?t=1746078175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/5ede34a7c2f1dcb6940f6bd6ed99f271.webm?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/5ede34a7c2f1dcb6940f6bd6ed99f271.mp4?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/1e227791f7392e082fe8a4203f2784dd.poster.avif?t=1746078175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/1e227791f7392e082fe8a4203f2784dd.webm?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/1e227791f7392e082fe8a4203f2784dd.mp4?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/b16db2d5838fda6d2a29410cfc5afd1d.avif?t=1746078175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For their own reasons, the yokai inside the barrier won\u2019t try to kill you immediately. Even if you are attacked once, your allies can help you recover and resume your escape. I dread to think of what would happen if you were alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/9ae851bb60816f56c593df6ad0a2dfcb.poster.avif?t=1746078175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/9ae851bb60816f56c593df6ad0a2dfcb.webm?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/9ae851bb60816f56c593df6ad0a2dfcb.mp4?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/48d2cda3c426137a22e4d5438958ff41.avif?t=1746078175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The longer you linger inside the barrier, the more the unearthly aura of the space will erode your humanity, until you become something else. Hold onto your humanity while you make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/c1988e3d7a5c0c9fb197c98aa30a8404.poster.avif?t=1746078175\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/c1988e3d7a5c0c9fb197c98aa30a8404.webm?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299060/extras/c1988e3d7a5c0c9fb197c98aa30a8404.mp4?t=1746078175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "NOROI KAGO: the Grudged Domain is a four-player co-op survival horror game based on &quot;Yokai&quot;, supernatural beings from Japanese folklore. Trapped in a cursed domain, you and your companions must work together to endure the curse and find a way to escape, all the while hiding from the roaming yokai.",
